  "bio": "Discover the bold artistry of BLACK BONES TATTOO, Curitiba's premier destination for black & gray ink aficionados. Nestled in the vibrant heart of Brazil, our studio blends modern technique with timeless style, ensuring each design is as unique as our clients. Connect with our masterful artists at tattooneto, call us at (041)99613-2965, or reach out via blackbonestattoo@gmail.com to etch your vision into reality.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Curitiba, Parana, Brazil"
